WOLF SHAPER: CREDITS AND SOURCE CODE
====================================

Wolf Shaper is a free, open-source waveshaper plugin made by Patrick Desaulniers.
https://github.com/wolf-plugins/wolf-shaper

This is Wolf Shaper v1.0.2 for Mac (VST3, Apple Silicon and Intel), built by
Sonic Weaponry from Wolf Shaper's source code. We changed it in October and
November 2026 so that racks and projects saved on Windows work on Mac:
- The Mac VST3 reports the same plugin ID as the Windows VST3, so projects
  saved on Windows find it.
- It's built so that it sounds the same as the official Windows version
  (the oversampling filter, and the same arithmetic on Apple Silicon).
- Saved settings load correctly when the host uses a comma for decimals
  (a fix from DPF by Filipe Coelho).
- The plugin carries an Info.plist (a fix from DPF by Filipe Coelho) and
  these license files.
Everything else is Wolf Shaper v1.0.2 as its author released it. Wolf
Shaper's authors don't endorse Sonic Weaponry.


